 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"f10c815b-7aee-4158-83f4-1589b84dd7e5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The token stores the two walks and the relation options ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<NullHomotopicCycles\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "60bc69ce-015c-4f0e-bda1-3aa3102e3d1c"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<FreeHomotopy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52481e51-7b00-431d-b372-6f345c8a7dd2"],
 ". It does not search for a homotopy or assert that one exists."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"85d0ea4c-38d7-427d-89f5-576efda8d300"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["FindInfraHomotopy"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/FindInfraHomotopy", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
