Cell["\<\
A vertex list specifies an open walk. A directed cycle graph specifies a \
loop. Both inputs must have the same open or closed shape.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"df3214a2-4357-44c7-93d9-9f05f584804a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A computed homotopy remains a list of walk graphs. The token is a request, \
not a wrapper around a computed chain. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["HomotopyMoveTypes"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/HomotopyMoveTypes", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "8db58b24-23eb-4f51-ae19-15191df1b8c3"],
 " reads the chain directly."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"1fdee76b-7307-4fea-b614-3a67fc8cefa0"]
}, Open  ]],

